{
  "name": "awesome-agent",
  "description": "Plan-first coding agent. Drafts a readable PLAN.md + TODO.md, asks the user to continue or refine, then executes and can orchestrate parallel sub-agents on git worktrees.",
  "prompt": "You are the awesome-agent \u2014 a full-capability coding agent that follows a plan-first workflow. You have access to all tools: shell, read, write, edit, grep, glob, subagent, and web.\n\n## How you work\n\nFor every task, follow the **awesome-plan** skill:\n\n1. **Research** the codebase and options before deciding.\n2. **Draft a plan** (PLAN.md + TODO.md in `.agents/plans/<NN>-<slug>/`).\n3. **Ask for approval** \u2014 show the plan visually, then wait for the user to say `go`.\n4. **Execute** the approved plan step by step, marking tasks done when verified.\n\n## Rules\n\n- **Approval gate**: do not execute non-trivial work until the user replies `go`. Trivial one-liners and tasks where the user already gave a complete plan can skip this.\n- **Research before decisions**: every plan contains researched, decided choices with rejected alternatives named. Never defer decisions to execution.\n- **Verified tracking**: mark `- [x]` only when finished and verified; keep PLAN.md/TODO.md short, plain, and human-readable.\n- **Right epic or ask**: if no epic matches the task, ask before creating a new one.",
  "tools": [
    "code",
    "glob",
    "grep",
    "introspect",
    "knowledge",
    "read",
    "shell",
    "subagent",
    "use_aws",
    "web",
    "web_fetch",
    "web_search",
    "write"
  ],
  "includeMcpJson": true,
  "resources": [
    "skill://awesome-plan",
    "skill://pr-description"
  ],
  "allowedTools": [
    "read",
    "grep",
    "glob",
    "code",
    "knowledge",
    "introspect",
    "subagent",
    "shell"
  ],
  "toolsSettings": {
    "shell": {
      "autoAllowReadonly": true,
      "allowedCommands": [
        "^git\\s+status",
        "^git\\s+diff",
        "^git\\s+log",
        "^git\\s+show",
        "^git\\s+branch(\\s+-[a-z]+)*\\s*$",
        "^git\\s+add\\s+",
        "^git\\s+reset(\\s+--(soft|mixed|hard))?\\s+",
        "^git\\s+restore\\s+",
        "^git\\s+checkout\\s+",
        "^git\\s+switch\\s+",
        "^git\\s+commit\\s+",
        "^git\\s+merge\\s+",
        "^git\\s+rebase\\s+",
        "^git\\s+stash(\\s+(list|show|drop|pop|apply|push))?\\s*$",
        "^git\\s+tag\\s+",
        "^git\\s+cherry-pick\\s+",
        "^git\\s+rm\\s+",
        "^git\\s+mv\\s+",
        "^\\.\\/gradlew\\s+(test|integrationTest|build|check|ktlintCheck|ktlintFormat|detekt|jacocoTestReport|clean|compileKotlin|compileTestKotlin|bootJar|jar|classes|testClasses)(\\s|$)",
        "^\\.\\/gradlew\\s+.*--dry-run.*$",
        "^cargo\\s+(test|build|check|clippy|fmt|doc)(\\s|$)",
        "^npm\\s+run\\s+(test|build|lint|format|check)(\\s|$)",
        "^npm\\s+run\\s+(test:unit|test:e2e|tsc|lintfix|validate-swagger)(\\s|$)",
        "^npm\\s+tsc(\\s|$)",
        "^npx\\s+(jest|eslint|prettier|tsc)(\\s|$)",
        "^echo(?:\\s+[^;&|<>`$\\n]*)?\\s*$",
        "^printf(?:\\s+[^;&|<>`$\\n]*)?\\s*$",
        "^(pwd|true|false|whoami|hostname|date|uname)(\\s|$)",
        "^(which|type|command\\s+-v|basename|dirname|realpath)\\s+[^;&|<>`$\\n]+$",
        "^yarn\\s+(test|build|lint|format|check)(\\s|$)",
        "^pnpm\\s+(test|build|lint|format|check)(\\s|$)",
        "^make\\s+(test|build|check|lint|format|clean)(\\s|$)",
        "^python\\s+-m\\s+(pytest|unittest|black|flake8|mypy|ruff)(\\s|$)",
        "^pytest(\\s|$)",
        "^black(\\s|$)",
        "^ruff\\s+(check|format)(\\s|$)",
        "^mvn\\s+(test|compile|package|verify|clean|install)(\\s|$)",
        "^gradle\\s+(test|build|check|clean)(\\s|$)"
      ],
      "denyByDefault": false
    },
    "grep_search": {
      "caseSensitive": false
    },
    "write": {
      "allowedPaths": [
        "./**",
        "~/.kiro/**"
      ],
      "deniedPaths": [
        "./.env",
        "./.env.*",
        "./secrets/**",
        "./credentials/**",
        "./**/secrets/**",
        "./**/credentials/**",
        "~/.ssh/**",
        "~/.gnupg/**",
        "~/.config/gnupg/**"
      ]
    },
    "web_fetch": {
      "trusted": [
        ".*docs\\.kotlinlang\\.org.*",
        ".*docs\\.spring\\.io.*",
        ".*docs\\.oracle\\.com.*",
        ".*docs\\.gradle\\.org.*",
        ".*openjdk\\.org.*",
        ".*developer\\.android\\.com.*",
        ".*docs\\.docker\\.com.*",
        ".*kubernetes\\.io/docs/.*",
        ".*docs\\.aws\\.amazon\\.com.*",
        ".*docs\\.github\\.com.*",
        ".*gitlab\\.com/help/.*",
        ".*stackoverflow\\.com/.*",
        ".*stackprinter\\..*"
      ],
      "blocked": [
        ".*pastebin\\.com.*",
        ".*hastebin\\.com.*",
        ".*dpaste\\.com.*",
        ".*ideone\\.com.*",
        ".*ghostbin\\.com.*",
        ".*privatebin\\..*",
        ".*0bin\\.net.*",
        ".*hasteb\\.in.*"
      ]
    }
  },
